        <briefdescription>
<para>Builds one cell&apos;s codepoint label plus its guide-line overlay. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Writes <computeroutput>glyphText</computeroutput> as an escaped Svg &lt;text&gt; label at the cell&apos;s top-left, one horizontal hairline &lt;path&gt; per manifest guides-table row (at that row&apos;s offset from the cell top, in the colour-table colour of the row&apos;s key), and one vertical hairline &lt;path&gt; at each unit-cell edge inside the glyph and at the glyph&apos;s advance. The edge and advance positions follow the build&apos;s own advance rule, applied to <computeroutput>cellBounds</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>metrics</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>manifest</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The font family manifest, read for its guides and colour tables. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>metrics</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The manifest&apos;s metrics value tree, read for the cell width, plain advance and sheet scale. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>glyphText</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The cell&apos;s codepoint label text. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>cellBounds</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The cell&apos;s rectangle within the glyph sheet. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>labelColour</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The label&apos;s fill colour, as colour-table text. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>advanceColour</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The colour of the vertical unit-cell edge and advance lines. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>The cell&apos;s label and guide-line Svg markup. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
